    {
      "id": "p0220-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "During battle, Mettaton gains a humanoid body and becomes Mettaton EX. He then stops and asks the player a question:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.290192,
          0.197857,
          0.898888,
          0.234286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29113609326671425,
          0.1992857142857143,
          0.9068838584684409,
          0.23380714285714285
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "战斗中，Mettaton 获得了人形身体，变成 Mettaton EX。随后，他停下来问玩家一个问题：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29519373916590186,
          0.1957142857142857,
          0.9018118010944562,
          0.24
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "background": "transparent",
        "font_weight": 450,
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
