    {
      "id": "p0220-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The player is then asked to type an essay on their computer keyboard that answers this question. Once the essay is finished – or if time runs out – Mettaton EX will scan the player’s essay for specific keywords and respond with appropriate dialogue. Toby originally designed this system to recognize English answers, so getting it to work properly in Japanese required all-new programming code and technical adjustments.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.290192,
          0.271429,
          0.898888,
          0.381429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29113609326671425,
          0.27214285714285713,
          0.9068838584684409,
          0.38095
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "接下来，玩家需要用电脑键盘输入一篇短文来回答这个问题。写完之后，或者时间一到，Mettaton EX 就会扫描玩家的文章，寻找特定关键词，并给出对应的回应。Toby 最初把这套系统设计为识别英文答案，因此，要让它正常处理日文，就需要编写全新的代码并作出技术调整。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29519373916590186,
          0.27785714285714286,
          0.9018118010944562,
          0.38285714285714284
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "background": "transparent",
        "font_weight": 450,
