    {
      "id": "p0220-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "First, because Undertale was originally designed for home computers, players could simply use their computer keyboard to type an essay answer. Unfortunately, home consoles rarely come with keyboards. To get around this hardware issue, the localization team added new code to Undertale’s programming to display on-screen keyboards compatible with game controllers.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.290192,
          0.415,
          0.898888,
          0.507143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29113609326671425,
          0.4169071428571428,
          0.9068838584684409,
          0.5080928571428571
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "首先，Undertale 最初是为家用电脑设计的，玩家可以直接用电脑键盘输入答案。然而，家用游戏机很少配备键盘。为了解决这一硬件问题，本地化团队为 Undertale 添加了新代码，显示可以用游戏手柄操作的屏幕键盘。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 3,
            "end": 12,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          },
          {
